{"parse": {"title": "WPK-04", "pageid": 59798, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/WPK-03\" title=\"WPK-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">WPK-04</span><a href=\"/wiki/WPK-05\" title=\"WPK-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">WPK</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">04</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.BC.AB.E9.95.BF.E7.9A.84.E6.B1.9B.E6.9C.9F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"漫长的汛期\">漫长的汛期</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 漫长的汛期</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Flood Season</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>近<span class=\"color-value\"></span>日<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>本<span class=\"color-value\"></span>地<span class=\"color-value\"></span>区<span class=\"color-value\"></span>或<span class=\"color-value\"></span>将<span class=\"color-value\"></span>进<span class=\"color-value\"></span>入<span class=\"color-value\"></span>涨<span class=\"color-value\"></span>潮<span class=\"color-value\"></span>期<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>请<span class=\"color-value\"></span>各<span class=\"color-value\"></span>方<span class=\"color-value\"></span>做<span class=\"color-value\"></span>好<span class=\"color-value\"></span>相<span class=\"color-value\"></span>关<span class=\"color-value\"></span>防<span class=\"color-value\"></span>范<span class=\"color-value\"></span>措<span class=\"color-value\"></span>施<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 191404</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-sufubihaozhai.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"sufubihaozhai\"><img alt=\"sufubihaozhai\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-sufubihaozhai.png/600px-Cg-sufubihaozhai.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-sufubihaozhai.png/900px-Cg-sufubihaozhai.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-sufubihaozhai.png/1200px-Cg-sufubihaozhai.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>箱中房间的布设与实景几乎别无二致。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它照顾每一位受邀而来的住户，也妥帖地收容他们的好奇心与想象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>奥古布古，叫声奇异的水怪，淅淅沥沥的硬币雨，还有许多有趣的朋友们～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>今天的苏芙比又会遇见什么有意思的事儿呢……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>苏芙比小姐捋了捋裙摆，现在她更像一位真正的淑女了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>噢，我差点忘了——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>我和夏利小姐约好了，我们要出演一场勇者智斗恶龙的戏剧！希望她已经找好了合适的演员～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>否则的话，我就要给爸爸写信，邀请库耶列布希先生到这儿来担任临时演员了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她小声嘀咕着，最后一次确认了蝴蝶结的位置。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>淑女兴奋推开房门，丝毫没有注意到翻涌而来的——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>海潮声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>潮水泛着粼粼的金光，冲刷着所经过的一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-300912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-300912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-300912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>呀——这是怎么回事？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>难道这儿真的住着一位奥古布古先生吗？它打算把这儿都变成自己的巢穴吗？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>源源不断的水浪仍在翻涌着，只一瞬间就打湿了苏芙比的裙摆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>显然，这对淑女而言并不友好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而受害者也显然不止一人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>嗯……你好，奥利弗先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>雾行者浑身湿透地站在走廊上，模样看起来颇为悲惨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她好奇地望了望对方的怀表。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>现在不是下班时间吗？你居然还值守在这儿……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">雾行者：</div><div>不，这正是我的下班福利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他叹了口气，甩开裤腿上滴落的水滴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雾行者：</div><div>我向拉拉泉小姐许愿，希望今天能够准点下班。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雾行者：</div><div>于是她用水淹没了整个箱庭……现在所有人都必须下班了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>苏芙比还想说些什么，远处响起的惊呼声又吸引了她的注意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/49/HeadIconSmall-301720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/49/HeadIconSmall-301720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/49/HeadIconSmall-301720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>哇啊——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>苏芙比踮脚望去，一个狼狈的身影正以堪比魔精提科特勒的速度向她们跑来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>嘿～夏利小姐，你跑得真快～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>……你是在为下午的戏剧练习吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她羡慕地望着对方。<br />即使是上次失手放跑三百只侏儒鼠时，她也从未见夏利的步伐如此矫健。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏利：</div><div>…………</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>夏利停在了他们的面前，仍在大口地喘着粗气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏利：</div><div>我……我很抱歉……我似乎搞砸了……呜呜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>……嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏利：</div><div>我向拉拉泉小姐许下愿望，希望她能为我寻得一位能够饰演恶龙先生的演员……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏利：</div><div>拉拉泉小姐热情地向我询问了对那位演员先生的要求……从它的体格到惯用的攻击方式……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>噢，那太好啦——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏利：</div><div>不……苏芙比小姐……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她羞愧地低下了头，又继续说了下去。 </div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏利：</div><div>因此，她用泉水为我制造了一条真正的恶龙……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“恶龙”：</div><div>吼——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“恶龙”飞过，天空泛起一阵阵水雾。三人赶忙缩了缩脖子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>遗憾的是，糟糕的愿望似乎源源不断，没有尽头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……救……命……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>苏芙比循声望去，一个熟悉的身影正伏在草坪上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>噢——芭妮芭妮小姐，你还好吗？你看上去饿坏了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雾行者：</div><div>我同情你的处境，芭妮芭妮女士。但我必须提醒你，这儿的草地是不能食用的，它们还没有经过无害化处理……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>等一下，我这里有胃口饱饱药剂。你马上就会好起来的，我保证！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭妮芭妮 ：</div><div>药剂？！不，我不要再进食任何液体了——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭妮芭妮 ：</div><div>我吃下去的所有东西都会变成泉水……我已经两天没吃东西了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>芭妮芭妮惊慌地看着苏芙比掏出的瓶瓶罐罐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>哦，这实在是太可怜了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>雾行者理了理帽檐，冷静地安慰着众人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雾行者：</div><div>别担心，各位。按照目前的涨潮速度，箱庭马上就会被淹没，我们眼下的其他问题很快便不再重要了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他合上怀表，露出了背水一战的神情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雾行者：</div><div>现在最重要的是，我们必须尽快找到拉拉泉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一行人匆匆在荒原间奔走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏利：</div><div>我……我好像看到她了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-300910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-300910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-300910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>天呐——拉拉泉小姐在那儿，她不会摔下来吗？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_at_ys_lalaquan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_at_ys_lalaquan\"><img alt=\"2_0_at_ys_lalaquan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/Cg-2_0_at_ys_lalaquan.png/600px-Cg-2_0_at_ys_lalaquan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/Cg-2_0_at_ys_lalaquan.png/900px-Cg-2_0_at_ys_lalaquan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/Cg-2_0_at_ys_lalaquan.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_at_ys_lalaquan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>如果一点泉水不能解决问题，那就再多来一点儿～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>现在，每个人的愿望都实现了——崇拜我，尊敬我，都来和我做朋友吧～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>嘻嘻～原来实现愿望是这么快乐的事！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>远比完成一个史无前例的恶作剧还要快乐得多！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>难怪大家都喜欢许愿精灵——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>以后我就叫许愿精灵拉拉泉吧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她肆意地徜徉在浪花之上，任由水珠洒在自己的裙摆上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>另一边，在尚可以称之为“岸上”的地方，众人的呼喊声遥遥地传了过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>嗯，有人在呼唤我？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>拉拉泉在浪花尖上俯身，好不容易才发现远处两个小小的身影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-300910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-300910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-300910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>他们是在向我表示感谢吗……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>可我还要去帮助下一个人呢。如果把时间都花在客套大家的感谢上，伟大的许愿精灵可就没法实现所有人的愿望了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-303001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-303001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-303001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>两位热情的朋友，回见咯～！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她朝着远处几位蹦蹦跳跳的朋友鞠了个躬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>随后转身，大迈步地朝前走去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-303010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-303010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-303010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>哎——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>盲目自信并不见得是什么好事，尤其在如此坑洼不平的水浪上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/33/HeadIconSmall-302420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/33/HeadIconSmall-302420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/33/HeadIconSmall-302420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>你没事吧……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>泉水精灵抬起头。一个熟悉的身影正站在她的眼前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/33/HeadIconSmall-302420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/33/HeadIconSmall-302420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/33/HeadIconSmall-302420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>你有一个很好的派对，我们应该一起把它变得更好！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-303011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-303011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-303011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>你们是……</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "WPK-04"}}